Proprietary runtime dependency

Caroline's backend depends on the Claude Agent SDK (npm package
"@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk"), a proprietary package published by
Anthropic under its own license, fetched from the npm registry at build
time like any other dependency. It is not vendored or redistributed as
part of this repository; anyone building Caroline needs to accept
Anthropic's own terms for that package independently.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Vendored components

The following directories contain code originally developed as part of a
private monorepo and vendored here so this repository is self-contained
and independently buildable. Each remains licensed under the terms of this
repository (Apache License 2.0) as vendored, unless a more specific notice
is present within that directory:

  - backend/mcp-servers-src/*  -- MCP server implementations Caroline's
    backend spawns/bundles at build time (see backend/scripts/
    bundle-mcp-servers.mjs).
  - vendor/XcfaRenderer/       -- the Visual Mode playback/rendering engine
    (renders and plays back pre-built .xcfa talking-head model files). The
    separate, private pipeline that CREATES .xcfa model files is not part
    of this repository and is not open source.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Service-identity API keys

A small number of API keys embedded in this repository's source (for
example the SquirrelWisdom/Camerlengo backend service keys) identify the
Caroline *application* to its backend service, the way a public OAuth
client_id would -- they are not per-user secrets, and are not intended to
be kept confidential.
